generic_hash_key_arg.jux:12:11: [E0933] error: `double` cannot be the `K` of `Store`: a `double` has no hash by itself (floating-point values are not a key); a record or struct field of type `double` hashes by its bits; `Store` uses `K` as a `HashMap` key, and a key needs `operator hash` (§O.3.1)
